{"id":"949652e4222b24f5","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-equational-congruence.md","title":"等式理论诱导项代数同余","display":"thm-equational-congruence — 等式理论诱导项代数同余","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-equational-congruence","aliases":["56-thm-equational-congruence"],"display":"thm-equational-congruence — 等式理论诱导项代数同余","depends_on":["[[56-df-equational-theory]]","[[56-df-term-algebra]]","[[56-df-ground-term-algebra]]","[[56-df-sigma-congruence]]"],"source_section":"7.1.8","source_pages":"263","source_ocr_blocks":[284],"source_statement_status":"source-exercise-compared; local-derivation","source_proof_status":"local-closure-and-constructor-induction-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-equational-congruence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-equational-congruence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-equational-congruence — 等式理论诱导项代数同余"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59b9207cce58252c\" href=\"?note=59b9207cce58252c\" title=\"56-df-equational-theory\">56-df-equational-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"177a926e276b1a55\" href=\"?note=177a926e276b1a55\" title=\"56-df-term-algebra\">56-df-term-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"10806b2bbdb74dae\" href=\"?note=10806b2bbdb74dae\" title=\"56-df-ground-term-algebra\">56-df-ground-term-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d8f6f121e8472779\" href=\"?note=d8f6f121e8472779\" title=\"56-df-sigma-congruence\">56-df-sigma-congruence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"7.1.8"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"263"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>284</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-exercise-compared; local-derivation"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-closure-and-constructor-induction-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq T^2\">\\(E\\subseteq T^2\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}\">\\(Q=\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"59b9207cce58252c\" href=\"?note=59b9207cce58252c\" title=\"56-df-equational-theory\">56-df-equational-theory</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,I_T)\">\\((T,I_T)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(G,I_G)\">\\((G,I_G)\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"177a926e276b1a55\" href=\"?note=177a926e276b1a55\" title=\"56-df-term-algebra\">56-df-term-algebra</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"10806b2bbdb74dae\" href=\"?note=10806b2bbdb74dae\" title=\"56-df-ground-term-algebra\">56-df-ground-term-algebra</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_G=Q\\cap G^2\">\\(Q_G=Q\\cap G^2\\)</span>。同余谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d8f6f121e8472779\" href=\"?note=d8f6f121e8472779\" title=\"56-df-sigma-congruence\">56-df-sigma-congruence</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(T,I_T,Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(T,I_T,Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G\\ne\\varnothing\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(G,I_G,Q_G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G\\ne\\varnothing\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(G,I_G,Q_G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Exercise 7.1.8，本地展开推导：Q是含E的反身、对称、传递、替换和上下文相容关系的交，因此具有这些性质。若各参数成对Q相关，依次在相应一洞上下文中替换参数并用传递性，即得函数构造相容。限制到对构造器封闭的G仍满足同余各条；空载体不被称为代数。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003，7.1.8，印刷页 263。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 为本地DjVu文字层页块序号，不是物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-equational-theory","status":"resolved","id":"59b9207cce58252c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-equational-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-term-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"177a926e276b1a55","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-term-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-ground-term-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"10806b2bbdb74dae","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-ground-term-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-sigma-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"d8f6f121e8472779","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-sigma-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-equational-theory","status":"resolved","id":"59b9207cce58252c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$、$E\\subseteq T^2$。$Q=\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}$ 见 [[56-df-equational-theory]]。$(T,I_T)$、$(G,I_G)$ 分别见 [[56-df-term-algebra]]、[[56-df-ground-term-algebra]]，$Q_G=Q\\cap G^2$。同余谓词见 [[56-df-sigma-congruence]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-term-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"177a926e276b1a55","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$、$E\\subseteq T^2$。$Q=\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}$ 见 [[56-df-equational-theory]]。$(T,I_T)$、$(G,I_G)$ 分别见 [[56-df-term-algebra]]、[[56-df-ground-term-algebra]]，$Q_G=Q\\cap G^2$。同余谓词见 [[56-df-sigma-congruence]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-ground-term-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"10806b2bbdb74dae","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$、$E\\subseteq T^2$。$Q=\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}$ 见 [[56-df-equational-theory]]。$(T,I_T)$、$(G,I_G)$ 分别见 [[56-df-term-algebra]]、[[56-df-ground-term-algebra]]，$Q_G=Q\\cap G^2$。同余谓词见 [[56-df-sigma-congruence]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-sigma-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"d8f6f121e8472779","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$、$E\\subseteq T^2$。$Q=\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}$ 见 [[56-df-equational-theory]]。$(T,I_T)$、$(G,I_G)$ 分别见 [[56-df-term-algebra]]、[[56-df-ground-term-algebra]]，$Q_G=Q\\cap G^2$。同余谓词见 [[56-df-sigma-congruence]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"Q=\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}","display":false},{"tex":"(T,I_T)","display":false},{"tex":"(G,I_G)","display":false},{"tex":"Q_G=Q\\cap G^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(T,I_T,Q).","display":true},{"tex":"G\\ne\\varnothing\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(G,I_G,Q_G).","display":true}],"bytes":1667,"backlinks":[{"id":"6f90a5c149724deb"